	&amp;lt;element name="Enspelled Staff (Cantrip)" type="Magic Item" source="Dungeon Master’s Guide (2024)" id="ID_WOTC_DMG24_MAGIC_ITEM_ENSPELLED_STAFF_CANTRIP"&amp;gt;
		&amp;lt;description&amp;gt;
			&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;Bound into this staff is a cantrip. The cantrip is determined when the staff is created and can be of any school of magic. The staff has 6 charges and regains 1d6 expended charges daily at dawn. While holding the staff, you can expend 1 charge to cast its spell. If you expend the staff's last charge, roll 1d20. On a 1, the staff loses its properties and becomes a nonmagical Quarterstaff.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
			&amp;lt;p class="indent"&amp;gt;The cantrip's saving throw DC is 13, and its attack bonus is +5.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
