	&lt;element name="Staff of Striking" type="Magic Item" source="Dungeon Master’s Guide (2024)" id="ID_WOTC_DMG24_MAGIC_ITEM_STAFF_OF_STRIKING"&gt;
		&lt;description&gt;
			&lt;p&gt;This staff can be wielded as a magic Quarterstaff that grants a +3 bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls made with it.&lt;/p&gt;
			&lt;p class="indent"&gt;The staff has 10 charges. When you hit with a melee attack using it, you can expend up to 3 charges. For each charge you expend, the target takes an extra 1d6 Force damage.&lt;/p&gt;
			&lt;p class="indent"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Regaining Charges.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt; The staff regains 1d6 + 4 expended charges daily at dawn. If you expend the last charge, roll 1d20. On a 1, the staff becomes a nonmagical Quarterstaff.&lt;/p&gt;
		&lt;/description&gt;
