			&lt;/table&gt;
			&lt;p class="indent"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Regaining Charges.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt; The staff regains 1d6 + 4 expended charges daily at dawn. If you expend the last charge, roll 1d20. On a 1, the staff vanishes in a flash of light, lost forever.&lt;/p&gt;
			&lt;div class="reference"&gt;
				&lt;div element="ID_WOTC_PHB24_SPELL_CURE_WOUNDS" /&gt;
